<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end up, but underperform Italy.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end up, but underperform Italy.</headline>
<text>
<p>1525 GMT - Bonos end sharply higher on Wednesday in line with other markets, although they underperform Italian market. Ten-year spread over Bunds fell to 68 bps vs 70 bps.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 117.01 vs 116.62, yield 6.32 vs 6.36</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 117.01 vs 116.62 at Tuesday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.43/46 vs 84.52/53</p>
